---
title: "Sequence Diagram - Write a Story with AI"
config:
  theme: neutral
  themeVariables:
    background: '#ffffff'
    noteBkgColor: '#ffffff'
    noteBorderColor: '#999999'
    noteTextColor: '#000000'
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Parent
  participant W as Web App
  participant R as :StoriesRoutes
  participant C as :StoriesController
  participant GS as :StoriesGenerationService
  participant CL as :CreditLedger
  participant Q as :AiQueue
  participant P as :AiProcessor
  participant ST as :StoriesGenerationStore
  participant AI as :AiClient
  participant DB as Database
  participant AIS as AI Service

  Note over U,AIS: 1. Start generation
  U->>W: Click Write with AI on a draft story
  W->>R: POST /api/v1/stories/:id/generate
  R->>C: generateStory(req, res)
  C->>GS: startGeneration(user, storyId)
  GS->>DB: SELECT story (owner), users.aiBlockedUntil
  alt not owner / length custom / AI blocked / real name left in content
    GS-->>C: ApiError 404 / 422 / 403 / 422
    C-->>W: error
  else ok
    GS->>DB: SELECT story_text cost for this length
    GS->>DB: BEGIN, UPDATE stories SET generating (where not generating)
    alt already generating / child has read this story
      GS-->>C: ApiError 409 (rollback)
      C-->>W: 409 Cannot write now
    else ok
      GS->>DB: INSERT ai_requests (story_text, queued, creditsCharged)
      GS->>CL: holdCredit(userId, cost)
      alt not enough credit
        CL-->>GS: ApiError 402 (rollback)
        GS-->>C: ApiError 402
        C-->>W: 402 Not enough credit
      else held
        CL->>DB: UPDATE wallets, INSERT wallet_ledger (credit_hold), COMMIT
        GS->>Q: enqueueAiJob(story_text, ai_request_id)
        alt enqueue fails (Redis down)
          GS->>ST: finalizeFailure(ENQUEUE_FAILED)
          ST->>DB: ai_requests failed, recompute story status, release credit
          GS-->>C: ApiError 503
          C-->>W: 503 AI unavailable, credit refunded
        else queued
          GS-->>C: aiRequestId
          C-->>W: 202 aiRequestId
          W-->>U: Show "AI is writing..."
        end
      end
    end
  end

  Note over U,AIS: 2. Worker writes the story (background)
  Q->>P: processAiJob(story_text)
  P->>ST: markProcessing(aiRequestId)
  ST->>DB: UPDATE ai_requests SET processing (only if queued)
  P->>ST: loadGenerationInput(aiRequestId)
  ST->>DB: SELECT story skeleton, characters, topic, checkpoint templates
  P->>P: buildAiRequest(input)
  P->>AI: callAi(story_text, payload)
  AI->>AIS: POST /v1/story/generate
  AIS-->>AI: pages, scenes, questions, options
  alt success
    P->>ST: persistAiResult(aiRequestId, response)
    ST->>DB: BEGIN, ai_requests succeeded, write pages / checkpoints / options (origin ai), story ready
    ST->>CL: consumeCredit(userId, aiRequestId)
    CL->>DB: INSERT wallet_ledger (credit_consume), COMMIT
    opt story.useAiImage
      P->>P: queueStoryImages(storyId) (see 3.3b)
    end
  else AI error / content blocked / retries exhausted
    P->>ST: finalizeFailure(failed or blocked)
    ST->>DB: BEGIN, ai_requests failed / blocked, recompute story status
    ST->>CL: releaseCredit(userId, amount)
    CL->>DB: UPDATE wallets, INSERT wallet_ledger (credit_release), COMMIT
  end

  Note over U,AIS: 3. Web polls generation status
  loop every few seconds until finished
    W->>R: GET /api/v1/stories/:id/generation
    R->>C: getGeneration(req, res)
    C->>GS: getGeneration(user, storyId)
    GS->>DB: SELECT latest story_text ai_request
    opt still queued / processing after 10 minutes
      GS->>ST: finalizeFailure(STALE)
      ST->>DB: mark failed, release credit
    end
    GS-->>C: status, errorCode, errorMessage
    C-->>W: 200 generation status
  end
  W-->>U: Show written story or error message
